sequenceDiagram
    participant App
    participant Lib as Cache Library
    participant Cache as Redis Cache
    participant DB as Database

    App->>Lib: Get data
    Lib->>Cache: Check cache
    alt Cache hit
        Cache->>Lib: Return cached data
        Lib->>App: Return data
    else Cache miss
        Cache->>Lib: Cache miss
        Lib->>DB: Query database
        DB->>Lib: Return data
        Lib->>Cache: Store in cache
        Lib->>App: Return data
    end